    "Overview": "Loud / fast cars; Nascar; Motorcycles; Guns; Empty beer cans piling up in garbage cans; Beer cans, energy drink cans, and beer signs as decor; Posters and various decor of sensual / scantily clad women, UFC ring girls; Beer pong tables; MMA octagons, UFC; Trophy cases; Doorway pullup bars; Crosses; Vulgar graffiti; Neon signs",
    "Activities": "Keg stands; Heavy drinking; Heavy weed smoking; Lacrosse; Tailgating; Raves and Music festivals; Cornhole; Playing 2k, FIFA, Halo, or Call of Duty; Arena Rock and Metal concerts; Country music concerts; Snowboarding and Skiing; Flag football; Superbowl parties; Ultimate frisbee"
