  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "Bro Culture fashion features cargo shorts, cargo pants, jean shorts (or \"jorts\"), sportswear, camouflage patterns, baseball caps, and t-shirts or hoodies emblazoned with various energy drink logos. A fair comparison could be a more aggressive version of male Normcore fashion. Unlike many aesthetics, Bro Culture's color palette is not restricted; it can extend throughout the entire color spectrum."
  },
